  "title": "Bluetooth: Add ACL connection handle dissector table",
  "description": "Add the bthci_acl.chandle dissector table so plugins can register\ndissectors for vendor-specific Bluetooth ACL connection handles.\n\nDispatch the matching dissector after parsing the common ACL header\nand return when it handles the packet, preventing vendor-specific ACL\ndata from entering the standard fragmentation and L2CAP dissection paths.\nUnmatched connection handles retain the existing behavior.",
